                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Compared to other Nancy Drew games, the puzzles aren't intuitive, plot's a little weird, the lines/script doesn't sound realistic. I had to go online for the majority of the puzzles, and a lot of what's online is just using the hints in the game which give answers. Seems like a lot of people just don't get the puzzles. There's a character that teleports with different clothing, back and forth, depending on where you are, which is very unrealistic.",
